flowchart TD
    A[Usuario acessa landing publica] --> B[HomeController resolve visitorId]
    B --> C[Webhook interno /api/internal/landing/access]
    C --> D[Persistir LandingAccessEvents]
    D --> E[Notificar admins ativos]

    F[Usuario envia lead Cliente ou Prestador] --> G[POST /api/landing-leads/public]
    G --> H[Persistir LandingLeads com visitorId]
    H --> I[Notificar admins ativos]

    D --> J[AdminDashboardService agrega visitas]
    H --> K[AdminDashboardService agrega cadastros]
    J --> L[Calcular taxa de conversao]
    K --> L
    L --> M[Home admin exibe KPIs incrementais]
